This repository includes small extracts of two public datasets, in tests/data, cut from the
downloads by tests/data/extract.py.

BIRD Mini-Dev
  tests/data/bird holds rows of the financial and california_schools databases from the
  PostgreSQL version of BIRD Mini-Dev, with their database description files.
  Source: https://github.com/bird-bench/mini_dev
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  The extract is shared under the same licence.

Enron Email Dataset
  tests/data/enron holds 55 message files from three mailboxes of the May 7, 2015 release of
  the Enron Email Dataset prepared by William W. Cohen at Carnegie Mellon University. The file
  names drop the trailing dot of the release, which Windows does not allow.
  Source: https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~enron/
  The release note on that page describes the corpus as collected and prepared by the CALO
  Project and made public by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission during its
  investigation, with some messages deleted at the request of affected employees.
